{
  "version": 1,
  "source_hash": 1788160964734794888,
  "segments": [
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "cpuset: CPU and Memory Pinning",
      "source_hash": 1661221514329149341,
      "context_hash": 17835357575946669566,
      "translation": "cpuset: CPU 및 메모리 고정",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "CPU": "CPU",
        "cpuset": "cpuset",
        "memory": "메모리"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:45:04.752154Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "How cgroups restrict which CPUs and NUMA nodes tasks can use",
      "source_hash": 7541539410224673831,
      "context_hash": 17502642841809799974,
      "translation": "cgroup이 태스크가 사용할 수 있는 CPU와 NUMA 노드를 제한하는 방식",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "CPUs": "CPU",
        "NUMA nodes": "NUMA 노드",
        "cgroups": "cgroup"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:45:04.752156Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "What cpuset controls",
      "source_hash": 5250038925576343037,
      "context_hash": 18035217990201819292,
      "translation": "cpuset이 제어하는 것",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "cpuset": "cpuset"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:45:04.752156Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "`cpuset` is a cgroup subsystem that restricts which CPUs and NUMA memory nodes a group of tasks can use.",
      "source_hash": 4524962398192318971,
      "context_hash": 12127455749603172242,
      "translation": "`cpuset`은 태스크 그룹이 사용할 수 있는 CPU와 NUMA 메모리 노드를 제한하는 cgroup 서브시스템입니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "CPUs": "CPU",
        "NUMA": "NUMA",
        "cgroup": "cgroup",
        "memory": "메모리",
        "nodes": "노드",
        "subsystem": "서브시스템"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:45:04.752157Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:1/seg:1",
      "source": "It operates independently from CPU bandwidth and weight:",
      "source_hash": 11753745455422574307,
      "context_hash": 16770569149888933573,
      "translation": "이는 CPU 대역폭(bandwidth) 및 가중치(weight)와 독립적으로 동작합니다:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "CPU": "CPU",
        "bandwidth": "대역폭"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:45:04.752157Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:2/seg:0",
      "source": "**Bandwidth** (cpu.max): How much CPU time a group gets",
      "source_hash": 14665139502280938376,
      "context_hash": 6322095689782034976,
      "translation": "**대역폭** (cpu.max): 그룹이 얻는 CPU 시간의 양",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "CPU time": "CPU 시간",
        "bandwidth": "대역폭"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:45:04.752157Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:3/seg:0",
      "source": "**Weight** (cpu.weight/shares): How CPU time is divided between groups",
      "source_hash": 9606327024959102746,
      "context_hash": 5962441175079098105,
      "translation": "**가중치** (cpu.weight/shares): 그룹 간에 CPU 시간을 나누는 방식",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "CPU time": "CPU 시간"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:45:04.752158Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:4/seg:0",
      "source": "**cpuset**: Which CPUs are even eligible — tasks never run on excluded CPUs",
      "source_hash": 9393530167457143429,
      "context_hash": 6178470915802938489,
      "translation": "**cpuset**: 애초에 어떤 CPU가 사용 대상이 되는지 — 태스크는 제외된 CPU에서 절대 실행되지 않음",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "CPUs": "CPU",
        "cpuset": "cpuset"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:45:04.752158Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:5/seg:0",
      "source": "This matters for:",
      "source_hash": 15309495845554973603,
      "context_hash": 12817920802167449971,
      "translation": "이는 다음과 같은 경우에 중요합니다:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:45:04.752158Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:6/seg:0",
      "source": "**NUMA locality**: Pin tasks to CPUs close to their memory",
      "source_hash": 548775733308802368,
      "context_hash": 18261111390888109486,
      "translation": "**NUMA 지역성**: 태스크를 해당 메모리와 가까운 CPU에 고정",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "CPUs": "CPU",
        "NUMA": "NUMA",
        "locality": "지역성",
        "memory": "메모리"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:45:04.752158Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:7/seg:0",
      "source": "**Core isolation**: Reserve specific cores for latency-sensitive workloads",
      "source_hash": 4234411685256699073,
      "context_hash": 2498360851442203194,
      "translation": "**코어 격리**: 지연 시간에 민감한 워크로드를 위해 특정 코어를 예약",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "latency": "지연 시간",
        "workloads": "워크로드"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:45:04.752158Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:8/seg:0",
      "source": "**Hardware partitioning**: Assign CPUs to dedicated containers",
      "source_hash": 13474176439542165784,
      "context_hash": 10104674322045988060,
      "translation": "**하드웨어 분할**: 전용 컨테이너에 CPU를 할당",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "CPUs": "CPU",
        "hardware": "하드웨어"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:45:04.752158Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Interface",
      "source_hash": 7655632546613034002,
      "context_hash": 956404767769337178,
      "translation": "인터페이스",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:45:04.752158Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "struct cpuset",
      "source_hash": 13257522931711973085,
      "context_hash": 14535598694506023619,
      "translation": "struct cpuset",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "cpuset": "cpuset"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:45:04.752159Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "Each cgroup maps to a `cpuset` in `kernel/cgroup/cpuset-internal.h`:",
      "source_hash": 17739789441119003024,
      "context_hash": 7359638641724874561,
      "translation": "각 cgroup은 `kernel/cgroup/cpuset-internal.h`에 정의된 `cpuset`에 대응됩니다:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "cgroup": "cgroup"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:45:04.752159Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:3/seg:0",
      "source": "Flags",
      "source_hash": 14662362199530734789,
      "context_hash": 12550663945017291736,
      "translation": "플래그",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:45:04.752159Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:4/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Effective masks: intersection with parent",
      "source_hash": 11239501485014352077,
      "context_hash": 7694565702768927642,
      "translation": "유효 마스크: 부모와의 교집합",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:45:04.752159Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:4/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "The key cpuset invariant: a child's **effective_cpus** can only be a subset of its parent's **effective_cpus**.",
      "source_hash": 15680179214654857014,
      "context_hash": 17240112449049726105,
      "translation": "핵심적인 cpuset 불변 조건은 자식의 **effective_cpus**가 부모의 **effective_cpus**의 부분집합일 수만 있다는 것입니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "cpuset": "cpuset"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:45:04.752159Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:4/block:1/seg:1",
      "source": "If you write a CPU list that includes CPUs not in the parent's effective set, those CPUs are silently excluded.",
      "source_hash": 11311794724377040210,
      "context_hash": 12613993027066706882,
      "translation": "부모의 유효 집합에 없는 CPU가 포함된 CPU 목록을 기록하면, 해당 CPU들은 아무 알림 없이 제외됩니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "CPU": "CPU",
        "CPUs": "CPU"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:45:04.752160Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:5/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "How tasks are constrained",
      "source_hash": 8961086739492439926,
      "context_hash": 10117165566973115271,
      "translation": "태스크가 제한되는 방식",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:45:04.752160Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:5/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "When a task is added to a cgroup (`cgroup.procs`), or when the cpuset's effective_cpus changes, the kernel updates the task's affinity:",
      "source_hash": 5194613064898130731,
      "context_hash": 2246958924290899371,
      "translation": "태스크가 cgroup에 추가될 때(`cgroup.procs`) 또는 cpuset의 effective_cpus가 변경될 때, 커널은 태스크의 어피니티를 갱신합니다:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "affinity": "어피니티",
        "cgroup": "cgroup",
        "cpuset": "cpuset"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T23:32:30.918682Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:5/block:2/seg:0",
      "source": "`cpuset_change_task_nodemask()` — updates NUMA node policy",
      "source_hash": 8610472854155000811,
      "context_hash": 7811569104047971783,
      "translation": "`cpuset_change_task_nodemask()` — NUMA 노드 정책을 갱신",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "NUMA node": "NUMA 노드",
        "policy": "정책"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:45:04.752160Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:5/block:3/seg:0",
      "source": "`set_cpus_allowed_ptr()` — restricts the task to `effective_cpus`",
      "source_hash": 8196399500755254967,
      "context_hash": 10897458502549881342,
      "translation": "`set_cpus_allowed_ptr()` — 태스크를 `effective_cpus`로 제한",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:45:04.752160Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:5/block:4/seg:0",
      "source": "If the task is currently running on an excluded CPU, it gets migrated",
      "source_hash": 13956610792638809114,
      "context_hash": 4343753944484586339,
      "translation": "태스크가 현재 제외된 CPU에서 실행 중이면 마이그레이션됨",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "CPU": "CPU"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:45:04.752160Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:5/block:5/seg:0",
      "source": "Tasks in a cpuset can still set their own affinity (via `sched_setaffinity()`), but the result is always **intersected** with the cpuset's effective_cpus.",
      "source_hash": 647676510071592890,
      "context_hash": 11391170160526249140,
      "translation": "cpuset에 속한 태스크도 (`sched_setaffinity()`를 통해) 자신의 어피니티를 설정할 수 있지만, 그 결과는 항상 cpuset의 effective_cpus와 **교집합**을 이룹니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "affinity": "어피니티",
        "cpuset": "cpuset"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T23:32:30.918684Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:5/block:5/seg:1",
      "source": "You can't escape the cpuset through affinity.",
      "source_hash": 10251085691607449580,
      "context_hash": 3457418673253619294,
      "translation": "어피니티를 통해 cpuset을 벗어날 수는 없습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "affinity": "어피니티",
        "cpuset": "cpuset"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T23:32:30.918684Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:6/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Partition roots (v2)",
      "source_hash": 6613352780820694361,
      "context_hash": 11564619713238582776,
      "translation": "파티션 루트 (v2)",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:45:04.752161Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:6/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "v2 cpusets support **partition roots** — a mechanism to carve CPUs out of the parent's scheduling domain entirely:",
      "source_hash": 14434367557879145441,
      "context_hash": 10690891606889207377,
      "translation": "v2 cpuset은 **파티션 루트**를 지원합니다 — 부모의 스케줄링 도메인에서 CPU를 완전히 떼어내는 메커니즘입니다:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "CPUs": "CPU",
        "cpusets": "cpuset",
        "scheduling": "스케줄링"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:45:04.752161Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:6/block:3/seg:0",
      "source": "Partition states:",
      "source_hash": 15916553355636955445,
      "context_hash": 5748532679386253048,
      "translation": "파티션 상태:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:45:04.752161Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:6/block:4/seg:0",
      "source": "`member` (default): Normal cpuset, shares parent's scheduling domain",
      "source_hash": 17191937821185926354,
      "context_hash": 14541699971224618288,
      "translation": "`member` (기본값): 일반 cpuset으로, 부모의 스케줄링 도메인을 공유",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "cpuset": "cpuset",
        "scheduling": "스케줄링"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:45:04.752161Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:6/block:5/seg:0",
      "source": "`root`: Carves out CPUs into a dedicated scheduling domain",
      "source_hash": 17302963454210986186,
      "context_hash": 2836154512792599381,
      "translation": "`root`: CPU를 떼어내 전용 스케줄링 도메인을 구성",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "CPUs": "CPU",
        "scheduling": "스케줄링"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:45:04.752161Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:6/block:6/seg:0",
      "source": "`isolated`: Like root, but also disables load balancing within the partition",
      "source_hash": 11127551363923889951,
      "context_hash": 4693942454136353285,
      "translation": "`isolated`: root와 같지만, 파티션 내의 부하 분산도 비활성화",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "load balancing": "부하 분산"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:45:04.752161Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:7/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "cpuset and scheduler domains",
      "source_hash": 17812967503156551016,
      "context_hash": 5966951376267678414,
      "translation": "cpuset과 스케줄러 도메인",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "cpuset": "cpuset",
        "scheduler": "스케줄러"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:12:31.655613Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:7/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "When a partition root is created or CPUs are assigned exclusively, the kernel **rebuilds the scheduling domains**:",
      "source_hash": 9639962096947443850,
      "context_hash": 1221365664142996781,
      "translation": "파티션 루트가 생성되거나 CPU가 배타적으로 할당되면 커널은 **스케줄링 도메인을 재구성합니다**:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "CPUs": "CPU",
        "kernel": "커널",
        "scheduling": "스케줄링"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:12:31.655616Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:7/block:3/seg:0",
      "source": "This is expensive — each rebuild tears down and reconstructs per-CPU scheduler domain hierarchies.",
      "source_hash": 15262577245812654323,
      "context_hash": 1949814498402308114,
      "translation": "이 작업은 비용이 큽니다 — 재구성할 때마다 CPU별 스케줄러 도메인 계층 구조를 해체하고 다시 구성합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "CPU": "CPU",
        "scheduler": "스케줄러"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:12:31.655617Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:7/block:3/seg:1",
      "source": "Avoid frequent cpuset CPU changes in production.",
      "source_hash": 16768094028819327073,
      "context_hash": 13043176053899595423,
      "translation": "프로덕션 환경에서는 cpuset의 CPU를 자주 변경하지 마십시오.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "CPU": "CPU",
        "cpuset": "cpuset"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:12:31.655618Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:8/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "NUMA: mems_allowed",
      "source_hash": 5552619221299869550,
      "context_hash": 10274948739244930932,
      "translation": "NUMA: mems_allowed",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "NUMA": "NUMA"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:12:31.655618Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:8/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "`effective_mems` controls which NUMA nodes memory allocations can use:",
      "source_hash": 1642940144326546746,
      "context_hash": 15221696794925773144,
      "translation": "`effective_mems`는 메모리 할당에 사용할 수 있는 NUMA 노드를 제어합니다:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "NUMA nodes": "NUMA 노드",
        "memory allocations": "메모리 할당"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:12:31.655619Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:8/block:3/seg:0",
      "source": "With `CS_MEM_HARDWALL` set, tasks cannot fall back to other nodes even if their allowed nodes are full.",
      "source_hash": 7255651894873936143,
      "context_hash": 14747621255649316655,
      "translation": "`CS_MEM_HARDWALL`이 설정되어 있으면 태스크는 허용된 노드가 가득 차더라도 다른 노드로 폴백할 수 없습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "nodes": "노드"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:12:31.655620Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:8/block:3/seg:1",
      "source": "Without it, the kernel may allocate from other nodes under memory pressure.",
      "source_hash": 7513862493097331863,
      "context_hash": 18393681278279385901,
      "translation": "이 플래그가 없으면 커널은 메모리 압박 상황에서 다른 노드로부터 할당할 수 있습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
