        "memory": "메모리",
        "nodes": "노드"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:12:31.655620Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:8/block:4/seg:0",
      "source": "With `CS_MEMORY_MIGRATE` set, existing pages are migrated to the new node set when `mems_allowed` changes.",
